00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.261
So my final review is, for an open-source video model,

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:23.891
LTX 2.5 is extremely impressive.

00:04:23.891 --> 00:04:26.826
It keeps Lina consistent, handles complex movement surprisingly well,

00:04:26.826 --> 00:04:30.087
